This repository vendors PDFium in third_party/pdfium, which is distributed
under its own BSD-3-Clause license; see third_party/pdfium/LICENSE.

The DjVu decoder in src/djvu is an independent implementation written against
the DjVu bitstream definition for interoperability. Its generated constant
tables (src/djvu/zptable.inc, src/djvu/iw44tables.inc) are data definitions of
that bitstream, without which no conforming file can be decoded; they are
produced by the scripts in tools/ rather than transcribed by hand.

Test documents are not distributed with this repository. tools/fetch-samples.ps1
downloads them from the DjVuLibre project, where they carry their own terms.
